BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Life With Full Attention
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260204T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260204T214500
UID:4be8410e855e4b691be37b9e@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Buddhism’s vision of infinite consciousness\, exemplified by
  the Buddha\, is a vision of our human potential. We’re like an acorn th
 at doesn’t realise its potential is to be an oak tree. But we’re almos
 t perpetually distracted – planning\, worrying and fantasizing.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/life-with-full-attention
 -feb-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Buddhism & Deep Ecology Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260215T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260215T170000
UID:76224e4dfd34543f4aa2b617@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Join Sanghasiha\, Kavyamani and friends for a day retreat expl
 oring our relationship with ourselves\, each other and the other-than-huma
 n world as practitioners. There will be ritual\, guided and sound meditati
 ons\, talks and conversations as we deepen our connection with all the bei
 ngs that we share these lands with. Bring vegan lunch to share.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/buddhism-deep-ecology-da
 y-2026-02-15
END:VEVENT
